Below is a **minimal but production‑ready** “image‑to‑short‑URL” web app written in Node.js/Express.  
It lets anyone:

* Upload an image (JPEG, PNG, GIF …)
* Get a tiny URL (`http://<your‑domain>/abc123`) that will show the image
* Share that link with friends

Feel free to tweak the styling, database, or hosting as you wish.

---

## 1. Project structure

```
image‑short/
│
├─ server.js          # Main Express app
├─ package.json       # Dependencies & scripts
