./quicksort        # prompts for size
# or
./quicksort 20     # sorts an array of 20 random integers
```

Feel free to tweak the range of random numbers, the sorting implementation (e.g., use Hoare’s partition instead of Lomuto’s), or the output formatting to suit your needs. Happy sorting!

