| Lightweight micro‑service, quick bootstrap | Spring Boot + Spring WebFlux | Reactive support, auto‑config, ecosystem |
| Enterprise legacy integration (SOAP, WS‑Federation) | Jakarta EE + JAX‑WS | Full JAX‑WS spec, built into servers |
| High‑throughput RPC (latency‑sensitive) | gRPC | HTTP/2, streaming, code generation |
| Custom protocols (e.g., TCP for game server) | Netty or NIO | Non‑blocking I/O, fine‑grained control |
| Full stack (client + server) | Spring MVC / Spring Boot + RestTemplate/WebClient | Simplicity, Spring ecosystem |
| Containerized, cloud‑native | Quarkus / Micronaut | Fast startup, low footprint |

