| Concern | Recommendation |
|---------|----------------|
| **Storing passwords in cookies** | Never store raw passwords. Use a hashed token or better yet, don’t store a password at all. |
| **Cookie size** | Keep them under 4 KB. |
| **Secure flag** | If you’re on HTTPS, add `cookie.setSecure(true);`. |
| **SameSite** | In Servlet 4.0+: `cookie.setSameSite("Strict");` to mitigate CSRF. |

