## 3.  Concrete refactorings

### 3.1  Inject a `Random` (classic DI)

```java
public class Provider {
    private final Random rnd;

    public Provider(Random rnd) {
        this.rnd = rnd;
    }

    public int provide() {
        return rnd.nextInt();
    }
}
