#### 3.2.3 `ClientHandler`

```java
class ClientHandler implements Runnable {
    private final Socket socket;
    private final ChatServer server;
    private final String userId;
    private BufferedReader in;
    private PrintWriter out;
    private final ChatLog log;

    public ClientHandler(Socket socket, ChatServer server) throws IOException {
        this.socket = socket;
        this.server = server;
        this.in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        this.out = new PrintWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(socket.getOutputStream(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8), true);
        this.log = new ChatLog(userId);
    }

    @Override
    public void run() {
        try {
            // 第一步：接收 HELLO
            String raw = in.readLine();
            Message hello = Message.parse(raw);
            if (!"HELLO".equals(hello.type)) throw new IOException("Invalid first packet");
            this.userId = hello.from;
            // 让服务器决定是否忙碌
            if (server.isBusy()) {
                send(new Message("BUSY", "server", userId, now(), null, null, null));
                socket.close();
                return;
            }
            // 发送 OK
            send(new Message("OK", "server", userId, now(), null, null, null));
            // 记录连接
            server.addClient(userId, this);

            // 主循环：接收消息并转发给客服
            String line;
            while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {
                Message msg = Message.parse(line);
                server.dispatch(msg, userId);   // 交给 AgentManager 转发
                log.append(msg);                // 保存聊天记录
            }
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.err.println("Client [" + userId + "] error: " + e.getMessage());
        } finally {
            server.removeClient(userId);
            close();
        }
    }

    private void send(Message msg) {
        out.println(msg.toJson());
    }

    public void sendRaw(String json) {
        out.println(json);
    }

    public void close() {
        try { socket.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
    }

    private String now() { return Instant.now().toString(); }
}
```

#### 3.2.4 `AgentManager`

```java
public class AgentManager {
    // 用来保存在线客服信息
    private final Map<String, AgentSession> agents = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
    // 需要提示 UI 的监听器
    private final List<NewUserListener> listeners = new CopyOnWriteArrayList<>();

    // 添加客服（假设 agentId 通过 UI 登录）
    public void addAgent(String agentId, PrintWriter out) {
        agents.put(agentId, new AgentSession(agentId, out));
        // 触发 UI 更新
        listeners.forEach(l -> l.onAgentOnline(agentId));
    }

    // 删除客服
    public void removeAgent(String agentId) {
        agents.remove(agentId);
        listeners.forEach(l -> l.onAgentOffline(agentId));
    }

    // 当有用户连接时，通知 UI
    public void notifyNewUser(String userId) {
        listeners.forEach(l -> l.onNewUser(userId));
    }

    // 接受或拒绝
    public void acceptUser(String agentId, String userId) {
        AgentSession as = agents.get(agentId);
        if (as != null) {
            as.send(new Message("ACCEPT", agentId, userId, Instant.now().toString(), null, null, null));
        }
    }

    public void rejectUser(String agentId, String userId) {
        AgentSession as = agents.get(agentId);
        if (as != null) {
            as.send(new Message("REJECT", agentId, userId, Instant.now().toString(), null, null, null));
        }
    }

    // 转发客服消息给用户
    public void forwardToUser(Message msg) {
        ClientHandler ch = server.getClient(msg.to);
        if (ch != null) ch.sendRaw(msg.toJson());
    }

    // 监听器接口
    public interface NewUserListener {
        void onNewUser(String userId);
        void onAgentOnline(String agentId);
        void onAgentOffline(String agentId);
    }

    // 监听器注册
    public void addListener(NewUserListener l) { listeners.add(l); }
}
```

> `AgentSession` 只保存 `PrintWriter` 并提供 `send()` 方法。

#### 3.2.5 `ChatServer`

```java
public class ChatServer {
    private final int port;
    private ServerSocket serverSocket;
    private final ExecutorService pool = Executors.newCachedThreadPool();
    private final Map<String, ClientHandler> clients = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
    private final AgentManager agentMgr = new AgentManager();

    public ChatServer(int port) { this.port = port; }

    public void start() throws IOException {
        serverSocket = new ServerSocket(port);
        System.out.println("Server started on port " + port);
        while (!serverSocket.isClosed()) {
            Socket s = serverSocket.accept();
            ClientHandler handler = new ClientHandler(s, this);
            pool.execute(handler);
        }
    }

    public void stop() throws IOException {
        serverSocket.close();
        pool.shutdownNow();
    }

    // 服务器忙碌阈值
    public boolean isBusy() {
        return clients.size() > 10; // 例如同一时间最多10个用户
    }

    // 注册 / 解除客户端
    public void addClient(String userId, ClientHandler handler) {
        clients.put(userId, handler);
        agentMgr.notifyNewUser(userId);
    }

    public void removeClient(String userId) { clients.remove(userId); }

    public ClientHandler getClient(String userId) { return clients.get(userId); }

    public AgentManager getAgentMgr() { return agentMgr; }
}
```

> 服务器只负责转发；真正的业务逻辑（如“接收/拒绝”）由 `AgentManager` 处理。  

> **服务器 UI**：可以使用 Swing 实现一个简单的面板，列出在线客服、待接入用户。每当 `notifyNewUser` 被触发，就弹窗询问客服是否接收。

