## 1. Architecture Diagram (Text)

```
+----------------------+            +-----------------------+
|  Desktop PC (Master) |  ----TCP----> | Android Device (Slave)|
+----------------------+            +-----------------------+
          ^                                   |
          |                                   v
   TaskManager (Master)            WorkerServer (Slave)
          |                                   |
          |   <------- results ---------      |
          +-----------------------------------+

Master creates a list of Tasks → serialises → sends → WorkerServer receives
WorkerServer feeds Tasks to its ExecutorService/ForkJoinPool → executes →
result serialised → sent back → TaskManager collects → merges → final
```

