```java
// 简单的 4‑byte length 前缀
private static byte[] addLengthPrefix(byte[] nal) {
    byte[] prefixed = new byte[4 + nal.length];
    prefixed[0] = (byte)((nal.length >> 24) & 0xFF);
    prefixed[1] = (byte)((nal.length >> 16) & 0xFF);
    prefixed[2] = (byte)((nal.length >> 8)  & 0xFF);
    prefixed[3] = (byte)(nal.length & 0xFF);
    System.arraycopy(nal, 0, prefixed, 4, nal.length);
    return prefixed;
}
```

> 发送时： `conn.send(addLengthPrefix(nalBytes));`

