The compiler complains about the declaration

```java
int dealerBet = Math.min(new Random().nextInt(11), 10);
```

inside the `else` block of the round‑loop in **`GameModule.main()`**.  
A local variable named `dealerBet` has already been declared *outside* the loop:

```java
int round = 1;
