```java
// Remove the "int" keyword – keep the outer variable
else {
    dealerBet = Math.min(new Random().nextInt(11), 10);
    betOnTable += dealerBet;
    ...
}
```

With that change, the compiler will no longer complain about a duplicate local variable, and the game logic continues to work as intended.

