## 📦 参考：使用 Netty 的简易实现

如果你想进一步提升性能（非阻塞 IO、零拷贝、自动分帧等），可以将 `ServerSocket` 换成 Netty。下面给出极简示例，演示如何在 Spring Boot 中嵌入 Netty：

```java
// NettyServer.java
package com.example.socketreceiver.service;

import io.netty.bootstrap.ServerBootstrap;
import io.netty.channel.*;
import io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoopGroup;
import io.netty.channel.socket.nio.NioServerSocketChannel;
import io.netty.buffer.ByteBuf;
import io.netty.buffer.Unpooled;
import io.netty.util.CharsetUtil;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

import javax.annotation.PostConstruct;
import javax.annotation.PreDestroy;

@Component
public class NettyServer {

    private EventLoopGroup bossGroup;
    private EventLoopGroup workerGroup;
    private Channel serverChannel;

    @PostConstruct
    public void start() throws InterruptedException {
        bossGroup = new NioEventLoopGroup(1);
        workerGroup = new NioEventLoopGroup();

        ServerBootstrap sb = new ServerBootstrap()
                .group(bossGroup, workerGroup)
                .channel(NioServerSocketChannel.class)
                .childHandler(new ChannelInitializer<Channel>() {
                    @Override
                    protected void initChannel(Channel ch) {
                        ch.pipeline().addLast(new SimpleServerHandler());
                    }
                });

        serverChannel = sb.bind(9999).sync().channel();
        System.out.println("Netty server started on port 9999");
    }

    @PreDestroy
    public void stop() throws InterruptedException {
        if (serverChannel != null) {
            serverChannel.close().sync();
        }
        bossGroup.shutdownGracefully();
        workerGroup.shutdownGracefully();
        System.out.println("Netty server stopped");
    }

    private static class SimpleServerHandler extends SimpleChannelInboundHandler<ByteBuf> {
        @Override
        protected void channelRead0(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, ByteBuf msg) {
            String text = msg.toString(CharsetUtil.UTF_8);
            System.out.println("Netty received: " + text.trim());
            // 回复
            ByteBuf resp = Unpooled.copiedBuffer(("收到: " + text).getBytes(CharsetUtil.UTF_8));
            ctx.writeAndFlush(resp);
        }
    }
}
```

> 只需把 `NettyServer` 作为 Spring Bean 注入即可。  
> Netty 本身已提供线程池（EventLoopGroup）管理，省去了手工线程池的麻烦。  

