| 平台 | 检测手段 | 样例代码 |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Android | `Debug.isDebuggerConnected()` | ```java if (Debug.isDebuggerConnected()) { throw new SecurityException("Debugger detected"); } ``` |
| Android | 检测 `system/bin/sh` 进程 | ```java String cmd = "ps | grep -i 'sh'"; Runtime.getRuntime().exec(cmd); ``` |
| iOS | 检测 `substrate`、`cycript` | ```swift
