## 4. 客服端 GUI

### 4.1 主窗口 (`AgentGUI.java`)

```java
/**
 * 客服主窗口：显示等待列表、已接手列表，提供接受/拒绝按钮。
 */
public class AgentGUI extends JFrame {
    private final ChatServer server;
    private final DefaultListModel<String> waitingModel = new DefaultListModel<>();
    private final JList<String> waitingList = new JList<>(waitingModel);
    private final JButton acceptBtn = new JButton("接收");
    private final JButton rejectBtn = new JButton("拒绝");

    public AgentGUI(ChatServer server) {
        super("客服系统 - 等待列表");
        this.server = server;
        setDefaultCloseOperation(EXIT_ON_CLOSE);
        setSize(400, 300);
        setLocationRelativeTo(null);

        setLayout(new BorderLayout());
        add(new JScrollPane(waitingList), BorderLayout.CENTER);

        JPanel btnPanel = new JPanel();
        btnPanel.add(acceptBtn);
        btnPanel.add(rejectBtn);
        add(btnPanel, BorderLayout.SOUTH);

        acceptBtn.addActionListener(e -> handleAccept());
        rejectBtn.addActionListener(e -> handleReject());

        // 定时刷新等待列表
        Timer timer = new Timer(2000, e -> refreshWaiting());
        timer.start();
    }

    private void refreshWaiting() {
        List<ClientHandler> waiting = new ArrayList<>();
        server.waitingQueue.drainTo(waiting);  // 先取走，随后重新放回
        waiting.forEach(waitingQueue::offer);
        waitingModel.clear();
        waiting.forEach(ch -> waitingModel.addElement(ch.user));
    }

    private void handleAccept() {
        String sel = waitingList.getSelectedValue();
        if (sel == null) return;
        ClientHandler handler = server.waitingQueue.stream()
                .filter(ch -> ch.user.equals(sel))
                .findFirst()
                .orElse(null);
        if (handler == null) return;

        // 创建客服聊天窗口
        AgentChatWindow win = new AgentChatWindow(sel, handler);
        win.setVisible(true);
        handler.setChatWindow(win);
        server.addActiveUser(sel, handler);
    }

    private void handleReject() {
        String sel = waitingList.getSelectedValue();
        if (sel == null) return;
        ClientHandler handler = server.waitingQueue.stream()
                .filter(ch -> ch.user.equals(sel))
                .findFirst()
                .orElse(null);
        if (handler == null) return;
        handler.sendMessage(new Message(Message.Type.REJECT, "Agent", sel, "", 0));
        handler.close();
        server.waitingQueue.remove(handler);
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - 每 2 秒刷新一次等待列表。  
> - 接收后创建 `AgentChatWindow` 对话窗口，并把它与 `ClientHandler` 绑定。  

### 4.2 聊天窗口 (`AgentChatWindow.java`)

```java
/**
 * 负责与单一用户的聊天会话。
 * 支持发送文字、文件、图片；保存聊天记录。
 */
public class AgentChatWindow extends JFrame {
    private final String username;            // 用户名
    private final ClientHandler handler;      // 对应的 ClientHandler
    private final JTextArea chatArea = new JTextArea();
    private final JTextField inputField = new JTextField();
    private final JButton sendBtn = new JButton("发送");
    private final JButton fileBtn = new JButton("发送文件");
    private final JButton imgBtn = new JButton("发送图片");

    private final Path logFile;                // 本地聊天记录文件

    public AgentChatWindow(String username, ClientHandler handler) {
        super("客服 - 与 " + username);
        this.username = username;
        this.handler = handler;
        this.logFile = Paths.get("chatlog", username + ".txt");
        initUI();
        loadHistory();
        startListener();
    }

    private void initUI() {
        setSize(600, 500);
        setLocationRelativeTo(null);
        setLayout(new BorderLayout());

        chatArea.setEditable(false);
        add(new JScrollPane(chatArea), BorderLayout.CENTER);

        JPanel south = new JPanel(new BorderLayout());
        south.add(inputField, BorderLayout.CENTER);
        JPanel btns = new JPanel();
        btns.add(sendBtn);
        btns.add(fileBtn);
        btns.add(imgBtn);
        south.add(btns, BorderLayout.EAST);
        add(south, BorderLayout.SOUTH);

        sendBtn.addActionListener(e -> sendText());
        fileBtn.addActionListener(e -> sendFile(false));
        imgBtn.addActionListener(e -> sendFile(true));
    }

    /* 读取本地聊天记录 */
    private void loadHistory() {
        if (Files.exists(logFile)) {
            try {
                String txt = Files.readString(logFile, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
                chatArea.setText(txt);
            } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        }
    }

    /* 将消息追加到本地文件与 UI */
    private void appendToLog(String line) {
        try (BufferedWriter bw = Files.newBufferedWriter(logFile,
                StandardCharsets.UTF_8, StandardOpenOption.CREATE, StandardOpenOption.APPEND)) {
            bw.write(line);
            bw.newLine();
        } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        chatArea.append(line + "\n");
    }

    /* 发送文字 */
    private void sendText() {
        String txt = inputField.getText().trim();
        if (txt.isEmpty()) return;
        Message msg = new Message(Message.Type.TEXT, "Agent", username, txt, 0);
        handler.sendMessage(msg);
        appendToLog("[Agent] " + txt);
        inputField.setText("");
    }

    /* 发送文件或图片 */
    private void sendFile(boolean isImage) {
        JFileChooser chooser = new JFileChooser();
        int opt = chooser.showOpenDialog(this);
        if (opt != JFileChooser.APPROVE_OPTION) return;
        File file = chooser.getSelectedFile();
        if (!file.exists()) return;

        String type = isImage ? Message.Type.IMAGE : Message.Type.FILE;
        Message msg = new Message(type, "Agent", username,
                file.getName(), file.length());
        handler.sendMessage(msg);
        // 把文件直接写到 temp 目录，让服务器再读取
        try {
            Path tempPath = Paths.get("temp", file.getName());
            Files.createDirectories(tempPath.getParent());
            Files.copy(file.toPath(), tempPath, StandardCopyOption.REPLACE_EXISTING);
        } catch (IOException e) { e.printStackTrace(); }

        String prefix = isImage ? "[图片]" : "[文件]";
        appendToLog("[Agent] " + prefix + file.getName());
    }

    /* 接收客户端发来的消息（后台线程） */
    private void startListener() {
        new Thread(() -> {
            while (true) {
                Message msg = handler.receiveMessage();
                if (msg == null) break;
                switch (msg.type) {
                    case TEXT -> SwingUtilities.invokeLater(() -> appendToLog("[User] " + msg.body));
                    case IMAGE, FILE -> SwingUtilities.invokeLater(() -> {
                        // 直接把文件显示到聊天窗口
                        // 简化：仅显示文件路径，实际项目可用 JFileChooser 打开
                        String prefix = msg.type == Message.Type.IMAGE ? "[图片]" : "[文件]";
                        appendToLog("[User] " + prefix + msg.body);
                    });
                    case EXIT -> break;
                }
            }
        }).start();
    }

    /* 关联 ClientHandler 的 receive 方法（因为原来的 receiveMessage 只在内部使用） */
    public Message receiveMessage() {
        return handler.receiveMessage();
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - `loadHistory`：读取 `chatlog/username.txt` 并显示。  
> - `sendFile`：将选中文件拷贝到 `temp` 目录，以便 `ClientHandler` 在发送时能读取。  
> - 监听后台线程持续读取来自用户的消息。  

> **注**  
> - 为了避免 `ClientHandler.receiveMessage()` 需要是 `public`，我们在 `ClientHandler` 里把它设成 `public`（或提供 `forwardFromClient()`）。  
> - 在实际项目里要进一步处理 `IOException`，并在 UI 里弹窗告知用户。  

