## 8. Gotchas & Troubleshooting

| Problem | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| **Java 9+ refuses Nashorn** | Nashorn removed from default JDK. | Run Minecraft with a Java 8 JRE or add `--add-modules=java.scripting` + the Nashorn jar. |
