| **NullPointer when invoking JS methods** | `exports` is `null`. | Ensure the module sets `module.exports = { … }`. |
| **Thread‑safety** | Multiple threads access the engine. | Nashorn is not thread‑safe; keep all eval/Invocable calls on a single thread or synchronize. |
| **Console not printing to Node terminal** | Node process not spawned. | Call `node.spawnNodeProcess()` early, or modify `NodeInterface.console` to write to the process’ output stream. |

