## 1. Global (search‑all‑columns) filtering

| Approach | When to use | Typical code snippet |
|----------|-------------|---------------------|
| **DataTables** | jQuery‑based tables, auto‑paging, auto‑sorting | `$('#myTable').DataTable().search('text').draw();` |
| **react‑table** | Functional React component, client‑side | `const { getGlobalFilterProps } = useGlobalFilter();` |
| **ag‑Grid** | Enterprise‑grade grid, server‑side | `gridOptions.api.setQuickFilter('text');` |
