## 🔧 Ứng dụng Tính Toán GCD & Ngược dư (Extended Euclidean Algorithm)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Extended Euclidean Algorithm</title>
<style>
  body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#f7f9fc;padding:2rem;}
  .container{max-width:600px;margin:auto;background:#fff;padding:2rem;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1);}
  h2{margin-top:0;}
  .inputs{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .inputs input{flex:1;padding:.5rem;font-size:1rem;border:1px solid #ccd0d5;border-radius:4px;}
