## 4.  Optional Enhancements

| Feature | Implementation | Why |
|---------|----------------|-----|
| **Progress Spinner** | Use `lightning-spinner` during `uploading` | Gives feedback that the file is being processed |
| **Error Handling** | Add `showToastEvent` in `handleAttach` | Better UX on failures |
