];
```

> *The `timeline` field is just an integer here.  
> If you prefer dates, use strings in ISO‑8601 format (`"2023-10-07"`), or `Date` objects.*

---

## 2.  Sort a **copy** of the array

```js
// create a *new* array sorted by the timeline field
const sortedCon = [...con].sort((a, b) => a.timeline - b.timeline);
//   ↑ ascending order (earlier first)
//   if you want the latest at the back, flip the comparison (b.timeline - a.timeline)
```

