| Before | After | Reason |
|--------|-------|--------|
| `let imageIndex = 0;` inside `fetchStreetDetails` | removed | Prevents resetting every call |
| `const PictureURL = streetDetails.PictureURL;` | `paintingURL = streetDetails.PictureURL;` (global) | Makes the URL available to `updateImage()` |
| `updateImage(fetchedFeatureID)` | `updateImage()` | We no longer need the FeatureID inside `updateImage()` – the URL is already in a global variable |
| `const imageHTML = '<img src="' + paintingURL + '" ...>'` | template literal with `${paintingURL}` | Cleaner syntax, avoids accidental `undefined` |

