## 3️⃣  Kode Server Remote (di domain lain)

File: `brandinfo.php` di `https://remote.example.com/`

```php
<?php
/**
 * 1. Ambil parameter brand (lowercase)
 */
$brand = strtolower(trim($_GET['brand'] ?? ''));

// 2. Array mapping brand -> data (URL)
$brands = [
    'brand1' => [
        'logo'      => 'https://remote.example.com/assets/logo1.png',
        'link_daftar' => 'https://remote.example.com/daftar1',
        'mainbanner'  => 'https://remote.example.com/banners/mainbanner1.jpg',
    ],
    'brand2' => [
